We wish to implement this function using only 2-to-1 multiplexers. Shannon’s expansion
using w1 yields
f = w1(w2w3) + w1(w2 + w3 + w2w3)
= w1(w2w3) + w1(w2 + w3)
Let g = w2w3 and h = w2 + w3. Expansion of both g and h using w2 gives
