Y1 = w1w2 + w2y1 + w1y1y2
Y2 = w2 + w1y1 + w1y2
z = y2
These expressions lead to the excitation table in Figure 9.77a. Assuming the state assignment A = 00, B = 01, C = 10, and D = 11, yields the flow table in Figure 9.77b.
