6.12. Expansion of f in terms of w2 gives
f = w2(w1 + w3) + w2(w1w3)
= w2 ⊕ (w1 + w3)
= w2 ⊕ w1w3
The cost of this circuit is 2 gates + 4 inputs = 6.
6.14. Any number of 5-variable functions can be implemented by using two 4-LUTs. For example,
if we cascade the two 4-LUTs by connecting the output of one 4-LUT to an input of the
other, then we can realize any function of the form
f = f1(w1, w2, w3, w4) + w5
f = f1(w1, w2, w3, w4) · w5
